		<description><![CDATA[Dear Shakti, sailing the cosmic seas!  You saw so much more of the hidden world!  the dreams, the visions.  You were a free soul, wandering the land, finding a home in Sedona, AZ, where the visionaries have gathered.  You were a loyal mureed and friend, practicing the sufi way, finding deep connections.  You graced us all with your art, your paintings live on in many places, including the walls of my own house.  I am honored to have known you!  with Love,  Yaqin]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Dear Shakti, sailing the cosmic seas!  You saw so much more of the hidden world!  the dreams, the visions.  You were a free soul, wandering the land, finding a home in Sedona, AZ, where the visionaries have gathered.  You were a loyal mureed and friend, practicing the sufi way, finding deep connections.  You graced us all with your art, your paintings live on in many places, including the walls of my own house.  I am honored to have known you!  with Love,  Yaqin</p>
